  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:103px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/WallyWanka.JPG\" title=\"Wally Wanka\"><img alt=\"Wally Wanka\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"92\" src=\"/images/WallyWanka.JPG\" width=\"101\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/WallyWanka.JPG\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Wally Wanka</div></div></div>\n<p>Wally Wanka is an <a href=\"/wiki/Category:NPC's\" title=\"Category:NPC's\">NPC</a> who is found at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Portal\" title=\"The Embercore Portal\">The Embercore Portal</a>.  Wally used to be the owner and operator of the kingdom's greatest candy factory, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">The Embercore Path</a>.  His last great creation was chocolate coins covered in gold leaf that he made specially for the King also known as <a href=\"/wiki/King's_Coins\" title=\"King's Coins\">King's Coins</a>.\n</p><p>Wally Wanka is also a quest giver and gives out a series of <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Quests\" title=\"Category:Quests\">quests</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Wally_Wanka.27s_Quests\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Wally Wanka's Quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Strike_at_the_Candy_Factory\" title=\"Strike at the Candy Factory\">Strike at the Candy Factory</a>\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon's_Abysmal_Candy\" title=\"Abaddon's Abysmal Candy\">Abaddon's Abysmal Candy</a>\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wally_Wanka's_Candygrams:_Knucklepops\" title=\"Wally Wanka's Candygrams: Knucklepops\">Wally Wanka's Candygrams: Knucklepops</a>\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wally_Wanka's_Candygrams:_Limb-N-Crunches\" title=\"Wally Wanka's Candygrams: Limb-N-Crunches\">Wally Wanka's Candygrams: Limb-N-Crunches</a>\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wally_Wanka's_Candygrams:_Candied_Craniums\" title=\"Wally Wanka's Candygrams: Candied Craniums\">Wally Wanka's Candygrams: Candied Craniums</a>\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
